# Part I / Conditions sheet records — trauma and attachment (3.5 Trauma, attachment and loss)
# PTSD (incl. ICD-11 Complex PTSD) · Reactive Attachment Disorder · Disinhibited Social Engagement Disorder

CP_ROUTE = ("CHILD PROTECTION — if anything suggests abuse or neglect (a disclosure, an injury, sexualised behaviour, a "
            "child afraid to go home): listen, do not question or investigate, do not promise secrecy, write down the "
            "child's exact words with date and time. Report to Tusla as soon as practicable (Children First Act 2015; you "
            "are a mandated person) AND inform the school's DLP. Telling the DLP does NOT discharge your own duty. "
            "Supervision follows the action the same day; it never replaces it.")

